<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n77483" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παννύ̆χ-ιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>all night long</i>,
			agreeing with the subjects of Verbs, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὗδον παννύχιοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					2.2
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. γάρ μοι . . ψυχὴ ἐφεστήκει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					23.105
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. δ᾽ ἄρ᾽ ἔλεκτο σὺν αἰδοίῃ
					παρακοίτι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Sc.</u>
					46
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. δ᾽ ἄρα τοί γε [οἱ ἄνεμοι] . .
					φλόγ᾽ ἔβαλλον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					23.217
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. μέν ῥ᾽ ἥ γε [ἡ νηῦς] καὶ ἠῶ
					πεῖρε κέλευθον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					2.434
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. χοροί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					153
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ba.</u>
				862
			</span></i> (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἐλλύχνιον . . καίεται παννύχιον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					2.62
				</span></i>
			: neut. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παννύχιον</span> as
				Adv., <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Chr.</u>
				55
			</span></i>: regul. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ίως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>EM</u>
					650.48
				</span></i>
			.</div>
